window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Danger, passion, and a race against time—for fans of Outlander!</b></p> <p>Diabetic Bryanna Fitzpatrick has seen her own death, her body carried by a Highlander. But she can’t deny her mother’s desire to visit Scotland. Stumbling into an underground cavern in Eilean Donan Castle, she encounters a Highland faerie who sends her through time to 1310.</p> <p>Believing it is a dream, Bryanna agrees marry roguish Highlander Raghnall Mackenzie. His tortured soul and beautiful music speak to her, but her life depends on modern medicine. The way home is blocked. An enemy clan is attacking. Will Bryanna’s prophetic vision come true?</p> <p>He’s afraid to lose his heart. She’s afraid to lose her life. Can love survive across centuries?</p> <p><b>Read by</b><b><i> </i></b><b>the award-winning narrator, Audie finalist, and Earphones for excellence in narration winner, </b><b><i>Shane East, </i></b><b>and </b><b><i>Emma Wilder, </i></b><b>a classically trained actor and narrator who has worked all over the world on everything from steamy romance novels to Shakespeare.</b></p>"; 
